<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING-WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WINS WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>MARIBOR, Slovenia 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pernilla Wiberg of Sweden won a World Cup women's slalom on Saturday according to unnofficial results. Urska Hrovat of Slovenia was second and Lara Magoni of Italy third.</p>
</text>
